                   ----> E! Comment V1.1 <----

 This is a very nice comment door for Excelsior. It's got everything
 but dead slow ansi interface.. It's PD so you can freely distribute 
 it without having me breathing down your neck =).

                          Features....


   * Easy to use interface
   * Separate config file
   * Both username and comment about user
   * Does not use any rexxsupport librarys
   

